{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45644","headline":"行路难 三 · 贯休","name":"行路难 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见道傍废井生古木，本是骄奢贵人屋。\n几度美人照影来，素绠银缾濯纤玉。\n云飞雨散今如此，绣闼雕甍作荒谷。\n沸渭笙歌君莫夸，不应常是西家哭。\n休谁遗编行者几，至竟终须合天理。\n败他成此亦何功，苏张终作多言鬼。\n行路难，行路难，不在羊肠里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}